Z||000001||pontiacs4me||06-06-2001||01:06 AM||||Im getting ready to start making some reproductions of these vents.  I dont know yet it they will be bolt on, or fiberglass in, depends on the form of the original im copying from.  Most likely they will be fiberglass in, but they will look awesome, and will be worth the extra work.  I found some honeycomb mesh cloth, that I will make into a backing by saturating it with fiberglass resin.  Man theyre going to look great.  check it out.<BR> <A HREF="http://home.kscable.com/ccheney/ryanpict/gtpvents.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://home.kscable.com/ccheney/ryanpict/gtpvents.jpg</A> ||||reg||1
